WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.623
A graph shows mango 2, orange 1, banana 2. How many fruits altogether? Let us think

00:00:05.623 --> 00:00:09.352
carefully. Add all three categories. The answer is 5. Great work!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.248
A graph has 3 mangoes and 3 oranges. How many more is the larger group? Let us think

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:20.952
carefully. Subtract the smaller count from the larger. The answer is 0. Great work!

00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:26.793
One picture means one item. There are 3 banana pictures. How many bananas? Let us

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:31.469
think carefully. One picture stands for one item. The answer is 3. Great work!

00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:38.225
A graph shows mango 5, orange 2, banana 6. How many fruits altogether? Let us think

00:00:38.225 --> 00:00:42.310
carefully. Add all three categories. The answer is 13. Great work!
